  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Simple_Backups/BH_SB_Header.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"229\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此模組用於建立備份。您可以設定要保留的備份數量，也可設定儲存空間的最大用量。系統會自動刪除最舊的備份檔案。<br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此模組僅限於伺服器端使用。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">可透過以下指令手動觸發備份：&nbsp;</span>/simplebackups backup start</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmelanx\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Simple_Backups/BH_SB_PromoCard.png\" alt=\"廣告\" width=\"1903\" height=\"381\"></span></a><span style=\"font-family:verdana, geneva, sans-serif\">#廣告 #Ad</span></span></p>",
